    "reviewedAt": "2026-09-11",
    "notes": "Driven only through the documented single-turn mode (-p) with structured output. No credential handling: sign-in belongs to `grok login`, and the CLI offers no status command, so the crew reports sign-in as unknown rather than guessing. It writes no report file of its own, so the run's report is the text it streamed."
